 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nDistribuciones Ibérica SL                               MASTER SERVICES\n                                                        AGREEMENT\nCalle Mayor 15, 46001 Valencia, Spain\nCIF/NIF: ESB66601739\nReg No: ES-067171\n\nFROM                                                    FACTURAR A\n\nDistribuciones Ibérica SL                               Distribuciones Ibérica SL\nCalle Mayor 15                                          Avenida Diagonal 220\n46001 Valencia                                          46001 Valencia\nSpain                                                   Spain\nVAT: ESB66601739\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 21/02/2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\"), by and between Distribuciones Ibérica SL, with its registered office at Calle Mayor 15,\nValencia (\"Party A\"), and Distribuciones Ibérica SL, with its registered office at Avenida Diagonal\n220, Valencia (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A   Distribuciones Ibérica SL / Lucía Fernández\nParty B   Distribuciones Ibérica SL / Carlos García\nDate      21/02/2026",
